这些管制措施提出了三项实际保障措施:
(一) 在孤立的单一问题请求中评价安全关键决定头,除非对目标模式的多克偏差进行了核实;
(二) 在将问题捆绑在因果结构中时,将主要的高分决定头放在序列化的计划中;
(三) 对于未来的System 1模式培训,在不同的查询规格之间安装阻隔-对角注意口罩,这样共享的状态表示可以重新使用,而无需交叉的克-值污染。

blocks.en:
All datasets, evaluation harnesses, and experimental logs are publicly available at https://github.com/j2launay/jev-decision-models-xai .
The repository provides:
(i) the deterministic audit harness supporting local Ollama models (including single-token logprob scoring) and remote System 1 endpoints;
(ii) the 86 86 -case Planted System-Rule v2 benchmark suite across single, dual OR, multi OR, dual AND, near-miss distractor, and case-insensitive regimes;
(iii) the expanded N = 900 N=900 evaluation cohort and N = 250 N=250 Tensor Trust benchmark with hard benign negatives;
(iv) bit-identical SQLite prediction caches and Parquet result tables across all evaluated models; and
(v) automated scripts ( jev_xai/make_all_tables.py ) to regenerate all tables and statistical tests directly from raw outputs.

